  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_hammer_cbc98a0cbe939e254c377f492df64a169fb3980c7b5e5e1c3bdb16192c2bbe58f3">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>A hammer (the tool). Spelling variants homer / hamer / hamour. The hammer haft (handle) is recorded under the haft concept (see haft). The riding hammer is a separate concept (see riding hammer).</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
